
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>RGF Reporting Brief</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: system-ui;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        article {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 1rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }

        pre {
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }

        .review-warning {
            border: 1px solid #d69e2e;
            border-left: 5px solid #d69e2e;
            background: #fffaf0;
            padding: 1rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }

        .review-warning li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <h1>RGF Reporting Brief</h1>

    {% if warnings %}
    <section class="review-warning">
        <h2>정책 시행 상태 검토 필요</h2>

        <p>
            {{ warnings|length }}개의 검토 항목이 발견되었습니다.
            아래 내용은 자동 판정이 아닌 기자 확인 대상입니다.
        </p>

        <ul>
            {% for warning in warnings %}
            <li>{{ warning }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
    </section>
    {% endif %}

    <p>{{ a.discovery_summary }}</p>

    {% for cname in collections %}
    <section>
        <h2>{{ cname }}</h2>

        {% for o in a|attr(cname) %}
        <article
            data-collection="{{ cname }}"
            data-object-id="{{ object_id(o) }}"
        >
            <h3>{{ object_id(o) }}</h3>
            <pre>{{ o.model_dump_json(indent=2) }}</pre>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
</body>
</html>
